    [
     {
      "text": "Enum"
     }
    ]
   ],
   "doc": "What to do with residues the numbering scheme gives no antibody position.\n\nANARCI numbers one variable domain per sequence. Residues outside it -- a\nconstant/Fc region, an N-terminal tag -- have no antibody position and\ncannot share the numbering coordinate system.\n\nAttributes\n----------\nERROR : str\n    Fail the job if any sequence carries unnumbered residues.\nDROP : str\n    Align the numbered residues only, discarding the rest.\nRETAIN : str\n    Keep the unnumbered residues, padded against the numbered-domain\n    boundary. They are preserved, not aligned to each other.",
   "parsed": [
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "What to do with residues the numbering scheme gives no antibody position.\n\nANARCI numbers one variable domain per sequence. Residues outside it -- a\nconstant/Fc region, an N-terminal tag -- have no antibody position and\ncannot share the numbering coordinate system."
    },
    {
     "kind": "attributes",
     "items": [
      {
       "name": "ERROR",
       "type": "str",
       "type_parts": [
        {
         "text": "str"
        }
       ],
       "default": null,
       "text": "Fail the job if any sequence carries unnumbered residues."
      },
      {
       "name": "DROP",
       "type": "str",
